DVXB.IO(7)           Personal Website Manual           DVXB.IO(7)


NAME
     dvxb.io — Devkumar Banerjee's personal website

DESCRIPTION
     dvxb.io is the personal homepage of Devkumar Banerjee. The
     site is a browser-based terminal emulator that functions as an
     interactive portfolio, built with xterm.js, Three.js, Anime.js
     & Motion.

     It features over 25 shell commands, a virtual filesystem,
     ASCII art boot sequence, CRT scanline and noise overlay
     effects, an interactive resume viewer (neofetch-style), and
     integrations for Hacker News, weather forecasts (Open-Meteo),
     markdown rendering, and a Buildroot Linux VM via v86.

     The site also supports local LLM inference, AI model switching,
     tab completion, pipe operators, and auto-correction of mis-
     typed commands.

     Source code: https://github.com/aptitudepi/aptitudepi.github.io

FILES
     ~/.bashrc       Not applicable (it's a web terminal)
     /etc/passwd     Contains root, guest, dev, bot, ai users

